</tbody></table></div>
<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Array</h2><p class="text-gray-400 mb-4">Mixed. Soli wins the bulk native transforms; Ruby wins anything that calls a block per element.</p>
<p class="text-gray-400 mb-4">One caveat on <code class="text-cyan-400">difference</code>: it is <strong class="text-white">not</strong> quite like-for-like. Soli's <code class="text-cyan-400">difference</code> deduplicates its result, where Ruby's <code class="text-cyan-400">Array#-</code> keeps duplicates from the left operand (<code class="text-cyan-400">[1, 1, 2] - [3]</code> is <code class="text-cyan-400">[1, 1, 2]</code> in Ruby, <code class="text-cyan-400">[1, 2]</code> here), so Soli is doing strictly more work in that row.</p>
<div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 mb-10"><table class="w-full text-left text-sm"><thead class="bg-white/5 text-gray-300"><tr><th class="py-3 px-4">Operation</th><th class="py-3 px-4 text-right">Soli</th><th class="py-3 px-4 text-right">Ruby</th><th class="py-3 px-4 text-right">+YJIT</th><th class="py-3 px-4 text-right">+ZJIT</th><th class="py-3 px-4 text-right">Ratio</th></tr></thead><tbody class="text-gray-400 divide-y divide-white/10">
<tr><td class="py-3 px-4"><code class="text-cyan-400">flatten</code></td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">0.115</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">0.827</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">0.890</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">0.815</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right text-emerald-400 font-semibold">0.14&times;</td></tr>
<tr><td class="py-3 px-4"><code class="text-cyan-400">union</code></td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">0.683</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">1.432</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">1.432</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">1.476</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right text-emerald-400 font-semibold">0.48&times;</td></tr>
<tr><td class="py-3 px-4"><code class="text-cyan-400">join</code></td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">0.188</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">0.428</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">0.421</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">0.372</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right text-emerald-400 font-semibold">0.50&times;</td></tr>
<tr><td class="py-3 px-4"><code class="text-cyan-400">sum</code></td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">0.007</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">0.013</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">0.013</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">0.013</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right text-emerald-400 font-semibold">0.55&times;</td></tr>
<tr><td class="py-3 px-4"><code class="text-cyan-400">includes</code></td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">0.039</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">0.052</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">0.051</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">0.051</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right text-emerald-400 font-semibold">0.76&times;</td></tr>
<tr><td class="py-3 px-4"><code class="text-cyan-400">index_of</code></td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">0.040</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">0.052</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">0.051</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">0.051</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right text-emerald-400 font-semibold">0.78&times;</td></tr>
<tr><td class="py-3 px-4"><code class="text-cyan-400">sort</code></td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">1.132</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">1.322</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">1.337</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">1.316</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right text-emerald-400 font-semibold">0.86&times;</td></tr>
<tr><td class="py-3 px-4"><code class="text-cyan-400">reverse</code></td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">0.069</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">0.068</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">0.071</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">0.059</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right text-gray-400">1.17&times;</td></tr>
<tr><td class="py-3 px-4"><code class="text-cyan-400">intersection</code></td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">1.001</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">0.835</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">0.839</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">0.843</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right text-gray-400">1.20&times;</td></tr>
